    "sections": {
        "description": "Rural Blog is an extremely powerful &amp; flexible blog WordPress theme for lifestyle blogger, writer, personal website, freelancer, reviewer, traveler, instagram creator, photographer and anybody who wants a simple yet powerful blog site. It focuses on readability, minimalism and loading speed. Theme performance is 99/100 on mobile and desktop. Accessibility tested &amp; passed. Theme requires no third-party plugins, no Google fonts, only self-hosted built-in WordPress font libs, tiny CSS and Javascript, just your words. Rural is a classic WordPress theme (ie. not FSE theme) with Theme Customizer panel to customize header, footer, typography, layout.. View live demo at: https://rural-blog.owldraft.com"
    },
